{% set content %}<h1>Unsuccessful sign-in attempts</h1><p>Hello {{ ownerName }},</p><p>We detected {{ attemptCount }} failed {{ method }} sign-in attempts, last attempted at {{ lastAttemptAt }}.</p><p>IP: {{ ip }}<br>Device: {{ deviceDescription }}</p>{% if locked %}<p><strong>Your account is temporarily locked{% if lockedUntil %} until {{ lockedUntil }}{% endif %}.</strong></p>{% endif %}<p><a href="{{ resetPasswordLink }}" style="display:inline-block;min-height:48px;line-height:48px;padding:0 24px;background:#0B6B3A;color:#fff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:6px">Reset password</a></p><p>If this was you, no action is needed.</p><p>Use a strong, unique password and never share it.</p>{% endset %}{% include "layout/base.html.j2" %}
